 to collect product reviews, consumer data, and messaging; and integration, segmentation, automation, and analytics and benchmark features for its platform. Further, it provides Customer Hub, a consumer-facing portal that brings shopping, service, and personalization together in one place; and Helpdesk, an AI-powered workspace for managing consumer conversations across channels. The company serves entrepreneurs, small and medium-sized businesses, mid-market businesses, and enterprises. Klaviyo, Inc. was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts.","employees":2400,"website":"https://www.klaviyo.com","country":"United States","city":"Boston","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Andrew  Bialecki","title":"Co-Founder, Co-CEO & Chairperson"},{"name":"Mr. Luciano  Fernandez Gomez","title":"Co-CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Edward  Hallen","title":"Co-Founder & President of Marketing"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.87,"tpe":31.18,"ps":4.503,"pfcf":26.7,"peg":1.17,"pb":4.727,"ev_ebitda":19.34,"rev_growth":0.183,"eps_growth":0.357,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2351,"eps_growth_next":0.1868,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1241,"roa":0.04714,"de":31.61,"gross_margin":0.5318,"op_margin":0.1282,"profit_margin":0.09291,"current_ratio":1.818},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":17.87,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":null,"sector":31.18,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":4.467,"sector":4.503,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":21.81,"sector":26.7,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.17,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":6.515,"sector":4.727,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":11.78,"sector":31.61,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.264,"sector":0.183,"verdict":"Strong"},{"k":"eps_growth","label":"EPS growth (last qtr, y/y)","v":null,"sector":0.357,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"eps_growth_fwd","lab